    {
      "text": "I was led by the Spirit, not knowing beforehand, 1 Ne. 4:6. rod of iron … which led to the fountain, 1 Ne. 11:25. commanded Moses that he should lead them out of bondage, 1 Ne. 17:24. leadeth away the righteous into precious lands, 1 Ne. 17:38. led out of other countries by the hand of the Lord, 2 Ne. 1:5. God has led away from time to time from the house of Israel, 2 Ne. 10:22. they are led, that … they do err, 2 Ne. 28:14. devil cheateth their souls, and leadeth them away carefully down to hell, 2 Ne. 28:21. strait and narrow path which leads to eternal life, 2 Ne. 31:18 (33:9). began to lead … from one piece of iniquity to another, Alma 4:11. humble yourselves … and thus be led by the Holy Spirit, Alma 13:28. he led them by his power into the promised land, Alma 36:28. Command thy children to do good, lest they lead away the hearts of many, Alma 39:12. holy scriptures … leadeth them to faith on the Lord, Hel. 15:7. narrow is the way that leads to life, 3 Ne. 27:33. they were led even by God the Father, Morm. 5:17. Holy Ghost led them whether to preach, Moro. 6:9.",
